      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"8 · Population-scale analyses (ExPORTER → DuckDB)\"\n",
        "subtitle: \"Funding concentration, output-per-$, FOA type, and latency — no API caps\"\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  html:\n",
        "    toc: true\n",
        "    code-fold: show\n",
        "jupyter: python3\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "The RePORTER API caps result offsets well below NIH's annual award count, so\n",
        "all-NIH questions need the **bulk ExPORTER files in DuckDB**. This notebook runs\n",
        "the population-scale analyses directly against that store.\n",
        "\n",
        "> **Prerequisite:** build the store first (one time, a few minutes):\n",
        "> ```sh\n",
        "> nih-agent bulk build 2000:2025        # awards (2.1M rows)\n",
        "> nih-agent bulk build-pubs 2000:2025   # award→publication links (6.1M)\n",
        "> ```"
      ],
      "id": "a3f120a8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "from nih_science_agent.storage import duckdb_store\n",
        "\n",
        "con = duckdb_store.connect()\n",
        "print(con.execute(\"SELECT count(*) FROM awards\").fetchone()[0], \"award rows\")\n",
        "print(con.execute(\"SELECT count(*) FROM publinks\").fetchone()[0], \"publication links\")"
      ],
      "id": "f636c609",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Funding concentration (top-decile share + Gini)\n",
        "\n",
        "How concentrated is NIH funding among investigators? Computed over *every* award,\n",
        "not a sample."
      ],
      "id": "92016606"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "c = duckdb_store.funding_concentration(con, ic=\"NCI\", year=2021, top_n=5)\n",
        "print(f\"NCI FY2021: {c.n_pis:,} contact PIs · ${c.total_funding:,.0f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"  top 1% hold {c.top1_pct_share:.0%} · top 10% hold {c.top10_pct_share:.0%} · Gini {c.gini:.2f}\")\n",
        "pd.DataFrame(c.top_pis)"
      ],
      "id": "023f0e09",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "> The extreme top is inflated by large contracts/center grants attributed to one\n",
        "> administrative contact PI — aggregate shares and Gini are the robust read.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Diminishing returns at full scale\n",
        "\n",
        "Linked-publications-per-\\$ by PI funding quartile — the whole population, not the\n",
        "48-PI sample of notebook 5."
      ],
      "id": "163e450e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "p = duckdb_store.funding_vs_output(con, ic=\"NCI\", year=2010, funding_floor=250_000)\n",
        "print(f\"{p.n_pis:,} PIs · Spearman(support, pubs/$) = {p.spearman_funding_vs_pubs_per_dollar}\")\n",
        "pd.DataFrame([b.model_dump() for b in p.bins])[[\"label\", \"n_pis\", \"mean_funding\", \"mean_pubs\", \"mean_pubs_per_million\"]]"
      ],
      "id": "fde43013",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Output by FOA type (RFA vs PA)"
      ],
      "id": "b4014566"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "pd.DataFrame([r.model_dump() for r in duckdb_store.productivity_by_foa_type(con, ic=\"NCI\", year=2010)])"
      ],
      "id": "066b1f48",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Grant → first-publication latency (with censoring)"
      ],
      "id": "477ebbf5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "lat = duckdb_store.grant_to_output_latency(con, years=list(range(2005, 2013)))\n",
        "print(f\"{lat.grants_total:,} grants · {lat.grants_with_output:,} with a linked pub\")\n",
        "print(f\"  median time to first publication: {lat.median_years_to_first_pub:.0f}y \"\n",
        "      f\"(IQR {lat.p25_years:.0f}–{lat.p75_years:.0f}y)\")\n",
        "print(f\"  {lat.pct_censored:.0%} censored (no linked pub — recent grants + incomplete linkage)\")\n",
        "con.close()"
      ],
      "id": "c1d9209a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Censoring is reported, not hidden: silently dropping the ~40% of grants with no\n",
        "linked publication would bias the median downward."
      ],
      "id": "d8b767c7"
    }
